{
  "id": "living_led_motion",
  "name": "Living LED on motion",
  "description": "LED on at motion unless a ceiling light is on or there is daylight (a shutter open and a motion sensor above 16 lx); off 5 min after the last motion or as soon as a ceiling light comes on. Lux is only read while the LED is off, since the LED itself lights the sensors.",
